<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
<title>导尿生态机会评分看板 · 亚马逊美站</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f6f8f7;--paper:#fff;--ink:#263238;--muted:#718189;--teal:#236b6f;--teal2:#2f8d83;--mint:#dff2ee;--amber:#d99a28;--red:#c64d48;--line:#dfe7e6;--soft:#eef7f5;--shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(26,48,55,.07);}
*{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.55} a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);min-height:100vh}
.side{position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;background:#173f42;color:#eaf6f4;padding:22px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px}
.brand{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3px} .brand small{display:block;color:#a8d5d0;font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}
.nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px} .nav a{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#d9eeeb;font-size:14px} .nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}
.source{margin-top:auto;font-size:12px;color:#b9d8d4;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);padding-top:16px}
main{min-width:0;padding:24px 28px 40px}
.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:18px} .crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700} .date{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f696b,#2f8d83);border-radius:14px;color:white;padding:30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 310px;gap:28px;align-items:stretch}
.hero h1{font-size:30px;line-height:1.18;margin:0 0 12px} .hero p{margin:0;color:#e8f7f5;max-width:900px} .badge{display:inline-block;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px}
.decision{background:rgba(255,255,255,.13);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:grid;gap:12px} .scorebig{font-size:44px;font-weight:850;line-height:1} .decision .label{font-size:13px;color:#dcf3ef} .decision .tag{background:white;color:var(--teal);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;font-weight:850;text-align:center}
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:10px;margin:16px 0} .kpi{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:13px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)} .kpi .v{font-size:20px;font-weight:850;color:var(--teal);line-height:1.18;word-break:break-word} .kpi .v.small{font-size:17px} .kpi .k{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:7px} .kpi .sub{font-size:11px;color:#8a979b;margin-top:6px}
.section{margin-top:22px} .section h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 12px} .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px} .grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.panel{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)} .panel h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px;color:#274345} .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px} .chart{height:330px} .chart.sm{height:260px}
.scoregrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:12px} .scorecard{background:#fbfdfc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px} .scorecard .n{font-size:25px;font-weight:850;color:var(--teal)} .scorecard .t{font-weight:800;margin:3px 0 6px} .scorecard p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.bars{display:grid;gap:10px} .barrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr 86px;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13px} .track{height:10px;background:#e7efed;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden} .fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--teal),var(--teal2));border-radius:999px}
.donut-chart{height:330px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center} .donut-svg{width:100%;height:260px} .donut-legend{display:grid;gap:9px} .donut-legend-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:8px} .donut-legend-row:last-child{border-bottom:0} .donut-legend-row span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;color:#314b4e;font-weight:800} .donut-legend-row i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:999px} .donut-legend-row b{color:var(--teal);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.static-bar-chart{height:260px} .static-bar-svg{width:100%;height:260px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdfc);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}
.static-line-wrap{height:260px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px} .static-line{width:100%;height:210px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbfdfc);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px} .static-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 14px;font-size:11px;color:#496063} .legend-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px} .legend-item i{width:18px;height:3px;border-radius:999px;display:inline-block}
.metric{display:grid;gap:10px} .mini{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 0} .mini:last-child{border-bottom:0} .mini b{color:var(--teal)}
.matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px} .paramcell{background:#fbfdfc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px} .paramcell .head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:8px} .paramcell .title{font-weight:850;color:#24484a} .paramcell .hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px} .flag{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;background:#fff4df;color:#8a5a10;font-size:12px;font-weight:850;padding:4px 8px;white-space:nowrap} .flag.high{background:#e3f4f0;color:var(--teal)} .actions{display:grid;gap:10px} .actions li{margin:0 0 8px 18px;color:#43565a}
.keyword-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px} .kwcard{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)} .kwcard .kwtitle{font-weight:850;color:#24484a;margin-bottom:8px} .kwcard .kwterms{font-size:12px;color:var(--teal);background:var(--soft);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;margin:8px 0} .kwcard p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0} .ppcbadge{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;padding:9px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff8eb;border:1px solid #ecd3a3} .ppcbadge b{font-size:20px;color:#a86708} .ppcbadge span{font-size:11px;color:#8a5a10;font-weight:800} .kwfilter{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px} .kwfilter button{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer} .kwfilter button.active{background:var(--teal);color:white;border-color:var(--teal)} .ppcmark{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:850} .ppcmark.ok{background:#e3f4f0;color:var(--teal)} .ppcmark.warn{background:#fff4df;color:#8a5a10} .ppcmark.danger{background:#ffe8e4;color:var(--red)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px} th,td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:middle} th{color:#496063;background:#f0f6f5;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1} td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums} .thumb{width:48px;height:48px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:white} .typepic{width:58px;height:58px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:white;flex:0 0 auto} .typeitem{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;min-width:0} .typeitem b{display:block;color:#24484a} .typeitem small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-width:260px} .pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--soft);color:var(--teal);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 9px;white-space:nowrap}
.table-scroll{max-height:560px;overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:white} .table-scroll table{min-width:1180px} .risk{border-left:4px solid var(--amber)} .danger{border-left-color:var(--red)} .good{border-left-color:var(--teal2)}
.callout{background:#fff8eb;border:1px solid #ecd3a3;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;color:#6d4b16} .foot{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:22px}
@media(max-width:1280px){.kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
@media(max-width:1100px){.shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.side{position:relative;height:auto}main{padding:22px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid2,.grid3,.scoregrid,.keyword-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:720px){.kpis,.grid2,.grid3,.scoregrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:24px}}

.prodimg{width:56px;height:56px;object-fit:contain;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:white}
.imgcell{width:64px;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle}
.full{grid-column:1/-1}
#scenario>.panel+.panel{margin-top:16px}
.vocwrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:4px}
.voccol h5{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--teal)}
.vocitem{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;background:#fff}
.vocitem .vh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}
.vocitem .vn{font-weight:600}
.vocitem .vm{font-size:12px;color:#888}
.badge{font-size:11px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:20px;color:#fff}
.badge.P0{background:#c0392b} .badge.P1{background:#e67e22} .badge.P2{background:#f1c40f;color:#333}
.vocitem .vq{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;color:#555;line-height:1.5;border-left:3px solid var(--teal);padding-left:8px}
.vocmeta{font-size:12px;color:#888;margin-bottom:10px}
.vocwrap3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:4px}
.voccol .fill.g{background:var(--teal)}
.voccol .fill.r{background:#c64d48}
.voccol .barrow b{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;vertical-align:middle}
.voccol .track{display:inline-block;width:calc(100% - 300px);vertical-align:middle}
.voccol .barrow span{font-size:12px;color:#666}
.voccol h5{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--teal)}
.vocitem .badge.P0{background:#c64d48;color:#fff}
.vocitem .badge.P1{background:#d99a28;color:#fff}
.vocitem .badge.P2{background:#7aa6a3;color:#fff}
.vocitem .vm{word-break:break-word}
</style><style>
/* 版式修正：甜甜圈图例较多时自适应高度；表格面板内部滚动，避免文字压图 */
#segments .donut-chart{height:auto;min-height:300px;grid-template-columns:240px minmax(0,1fr);align-items:start}
#segments .donut-legend-row{align-items:flex-start}
#segments .donut-legend-row span{min-width:0;line-height:1.35;align-items:flex-start}
#segments .donut-legend-row i{margin-top:4px;flex:0 0 auto}
#segments>.panel{min-width:0}
#segments .table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}
/* 版式修正：1fr 的最小宽度受表格 min-content 影响会压扁同排面板，改用 minmax(0,1fr) */
.section.grid2{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr)}
.section.grid2>.panel{min-width:0}
/* 品牌结构：行1 = 品牌销量图 + 产品路线表并排，行2 = 分组集中度整幅（用户要求） */
#structure .static-bar-chart{height:auto}
#structure .static-bar-svg{width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;display:block}
#structure table{font-size:12.5px}
#structure th,#structure td{padding:6px 7px}
/* 产品路线表（半幅）：固定布局+允许换行，防止内容撑出/遮挡 */
table.route{table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
table.route th,table.route td{word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
table.route th:nth-child(1){width:20%}
table.route th:nth-child(2){width:31%}
table.route th:nth-child(3){width:17%}
table.route th:nth-child(4){width:12%}
table.route th:nth-child(5){width:20%}
table.route td .pill{white-space:normal;line-height:1.3;display:inline-block}
/* 集中度表 8 列，窄视口下固定布局+允许换行，防撑破文档 */
table.crit{table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}
table.crit th,table.crit td{word-break:break-word;text-align:center}
table.crit th:first-child,table.crit td:first-child{text-align:left;width:23%}
table.crit th:nth-child(2){width:13%}
table.crit th:last-child{width:12%}
table.crit td .pill{white-space:normal;line-height:1.3;display:inline-block}
.hero .lede{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 14px}
.hero ul.sum{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:9px}
.hero ul.sum li{color:#e8f7f5;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px minmax(0,1fr);gap:9px;align-items:start}
.hero ul.sum li .t{background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:#fff;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 0;letter-spacing:1px}
/* 产品类型量价对比：单列铺满 + 代表图列，全量展示不滚动 */
#segments{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
#segments .donut-chart{grid-template-columns:300px minmax(0,1fr)}
table.typetable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
table.typetable th,table.typetable td{padding:7px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7efed;vertical-align:middle}
table.typetable th{background:#f4faf8;text-align:left;font-size:12px;color:#496063;white-space:nowrap}
table.typetable td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
table.typetable th.imgcell,table.typetable td.imgcell{width:54px;text-align:center;padding:4px}
table.typetable td.imgcell img{width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #e5eeec;background:#fff;display:block;margin:0 auto}
.subnote{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#8a979b;font-weight:400}
/* 分品类价格带矩阵 */
table.pbmatrix{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px}
table.pbmatrix th,table.pbmatrix td{padding:7px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7efed;text-align:right}
table.pbmatrix th:first-child,table.pbmatrix td:first-child{text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}
table.pbmatrix th{background:#f4faf8;font-size:12px;color:#496063}
table.pbmatrix td.empty{color:#c3cccf}
/* 品牌结构：图表自适应（行1 半幅并排） */
#structure .static-bar-chart{height:auto}
#structure .static-bar-svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
/* 关键词趋势：小倍数迷你图卡（每词一卡，避免多线交叠遮挡） */
#keywords .kw-mini-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:12px}
#keywords .kw-mini{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px 8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfdfc);min-width:0}
#keywords .kw-mini-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-width:0}
#keywords .kw-mini-head i{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto}
#keywords .kw-mini-head .cn{font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:#263238;white-space:nowrap}
#keywords .kw-mini-head .en{font-size:10.5px;color:#8a979b;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
#keywords .kw-mini-svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:4px 0 2px}
#keywords .kw-mini-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;font-size:12px;color:#496063;gap:8px}
#keywords .kw-mini-foot b{font-size:15px;color:#263238}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="shell">
  <aside class="side">
    <div class="brand">Opportunity Lens<small>卖家精灵数据看板</small></div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#overview">机会总览</a>
      <a href="#kpi">核心指标</a>
      <a href="#segments">产品类型</a>
      <a href="#structure">品牌结构</a>
      <a href="#keywords">关键词需求</a>
      <a href="#price">价格机会</a>
      <a href="#scenario">场景痛点</a>
      <a href="#attributes">属性参数</a>
      <a href="#score">机会评分</a>
      <a href="#definition">产品定义</a>
      <a href="#risk">风险建议</a>
      <a href="#details">核心明细</a>
      <a href="#summary">报告总结</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="source">数据来源：卖家精灵 BSR 类目导出（node 3763321，2026-10-15，799 商品）。</div>
  </aside>
  <main>
    <div class="top">
      <div class="crumb">Amazon US / Health &amp; Household / Bladder Control Devices → 导尿生态（导尿袋·固定·外部套式·可穿戴集尿器·套装·配件）</div>
      <div class="date">报告月份：2026-10 - 卖家精灵 2026-10-15 类目快照</div>
    </div>
    <section id="overview" class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="badge">美国站 - 导尿生态(catheter ecosystem)机会评估</div>
        <h1>导尿生态机会评分看板 · 亚马逊美站</h1>
        <p class="lede">结论：盘子够大的刚需耗材市场，但内部是两种格局并存——三类真碎片化、三类已有领先者，且质量普遍做不好。建议<b>选择性进入</b>，从可穿戴集尿器切入。</p>
        <ul class="sum">
          <li><span class="t">盘子</span>六组 553 款、月销 66,811 件、$1,431,832，是本节点的耗材主力；但同节点盆底器械 160 款做到 $1,694,191——节点利润仍在盆底。</li>
          <li><span class="t">格局</span>集中度须分组看：导尿袋 / 引流袋、固定导尿管 / 尿袋固定、导尿配件 / 周边 三组碎片化（CR1 9.4%-13.3%），但导尿套装（CR1 28.5%、CR3 已 62.7%）与外部导尿管(避孕套式)（CR1 23.8%、CR5 63.8%）已有领先者——合计 CR1 5.4% 是六池相加摊薄的结果，不能当"无垄断"证据。</li>
          <li><span class="t">分化</span>纯套式导管 4.05★ / $36.48 已是高价成熟品类；可穿戴集尿器 3.27★ 六组最低，4 款低分 ASIN 贡献该细分 76.4% 的差评——质量洼地就是切入口。</li>
          <li><span class="t">决策</span>68 / 47 分：先攻可穿戴集尿器（3.27★ 洼地、CR1 18.6% 无绝对龙头）与套装（3.45★，须直面双头）；纯套式做品牌化守价。合规上 EXJ/NNX 只干净覆盖纯套式 69 款。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="decision">
        <div><div class="label">机会评分</div><div class="scorebig">68</div></div>
        <div><div class="label">风险评分</div><div class="scorebig" style="font-size:34px;color:#ffe4b0">47</div></div>
        <div class="tag">选择性进入：三组碎片化+刚需耗材+低合规门槛，以材质升级+套装+医疗背书整合</div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="kpi" class="kpis">
<div class="kpi"><div class="v">553</div><div class="k">导尿生态核心产品</div><div class="sub">6 组合计（已排除 86 款空分类 + 160 款边界）</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div class="v">66,811</div><div class="k">样本月销量</div><div class="sub">6 组合计（件）</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div class="v">$1,431,832</div><div class="k">样本月销售额</div><div class="sub">卖家精灵 2026-10-15 估算汇总</div></div>
<div class="kpi"><div class="v">$21.43</div><div class="k">加权成交价</div><div class="sub">销售额 / 销量</div></div>
