le="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:3px"><span>舒适度差 / 笨重</span><span style="color:#888">91 条 · 1.8% · 3.78★</span></div><div class="track"><div class="fill r" style="width:17.6%"></div></div></div><div style="margin:7px 0"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:3px"><span>说明不清 / 难安装</span><span style="color:#888">74 条 · 1.4% · 2.62★</span></div><div class="track"><div class="fill r" style="width:13.7%"></div></div></div><div style="margin:7px 0"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:3px"><span>异味 / 卫生</span><span style="color:#888">72 条 · 1.4% · 3.36★</span></div><div class="track"><div class="fill r" style="width:13.7%"></div></div></div></div>
