v><div class="vm">关联均星 4.13★ · 星级分布 低36 / 中17 / 高169</div><div class="vq">“★4 Foley Catheter stabilization Device is still holding strongly after one week. Sadly, I have to use it 24 hours per day but the stabilization device is holding the large…”<span style="color:#aaa"> — Gadget Beyond</span></div><div class="vq">“★5 These were purchased for my daughter&#x27;s Foley catheter; they provide a secure fit, though some leakage occurred when they reached capacity. Otherwise, they performed more…”<span style="color:#aaa"> — Gadget Beyond</span></div><div class="vq">“★2 Got these for my suprapubic catheter and they were great at first, really firm hold. But twice now in my sleep they&#x27;ve fallen off my leg and dropped my catheter all the…”<span style="color:#aaa"> — RYentte</span></div></div><div class="vocitem"><div class="vh"><span class="vn">出行 / 旅行 / 户外活动</span><span class="vm">220 条 · 4.3%</span></div><div class="vm">关联均星 4.11★ · 星级分布 低35 / 中15 / 高170</div><div class="vq">“★5 Bought this for my dad who has issues with frequent urination and incontinence. He was going to travel via plane and was concerned about using/finding bathrooms. He has…”<span style="color:#aaa"> — UltraFlex</span></div><div class="vq">“★5 Ever on super long zoom calls like all workday kind of calls? If you know you are going to be back to back on calls this is an item that could allow you to stay at your…”<span style="color:#aaa"> — PIBEIBUK</span></div><div class="vq">“★1 Bought this product under necessity. I started having problems since the first use. While I was sleeping the valve opened up causing a major mess. Out of the 4 bags I…”<span style="color:#aaa"> — Dynarex</span></div></div></div>
      <p class="note">①<b>夜间/睡眠</b>是最大场景但均星与整体持平——夜间失败不是「夜间特有」，而是渗漏/脱落在夜间代价最高（换床品、洗护、睡眠中断），因此「夜间防漏」是可被单独溢价的功能承诺（漏液评论中 78 条 / 14.8% 发生在夜间语境）；②<b>术后/住院康复</b>均星 4.41★ 最高、且差评最少，是口碑最稳、教育成本最低的切入场景；③<b>出行/旅行</b>均星 4.11★、被夸集中在「隐蔽/不漏/便携」，对应产品定义里的隐私包装与防漏；④<b>长期留置/特殊导管</b>（截瘫、骶骨上膀胱造瘘、肾造瘘）虽量小但忠诚度最高，是专业背书与复购锚点。</p>
